            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Which form asserts the event? (Hablas.) Which presents it as wanted? (Hables, after quiero que.) What happens when the wanter and the speaker are the same? (Use the infinitive: Quiero hablar.) Next, build the three singular -ar forms one piece at a time."
